### REST Client 联调脚本（VS Code REST Client 扩展可直接发送）
### 使用前确认：npm run db:up && npm run db:seed && node server/index.js

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. NFC 登录（admin 的 nfc_token 来自 seed-admin 输出）
# @name nfcLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/nfc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_NFC_TOKEN"
}

### 3. 获取当前用户（用 nfcLogin 返回的 jwt）
@jwt = {{nfcLogin.response.body.jwt}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 4. 密码登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 5. JWT 续期
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 6. 注册（需要先用一个未注册用户的 nfc 登录拿到 JWT）
# 测试用：可以直接在数据库插入一个空白用户
# INSERT INTO users DEFAULT VALUES RETURNING nfc_token;
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test_user",
  "password": "test1234",
  "city": "长沙"
}

### 7. 无效 NFC token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/nfc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### ----- Phase 2: 打卡与成就墙 -----

### 8. 公开 spots 列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/check-in/spots

### 9. 打卡（spot_01 签到台）
POST {{baseUrl}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spotToken": "11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### 10. 重复打卡同一点位（应 alreadyCheckedIn=true）
POST {{baseUrl}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spotToken": "11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### 11. 成就墙状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/check-in/status
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 12. 无效 spotToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spotToken": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### ----- Phase 3: 后台管理 -----

### 13. 用户列表（含搜索）
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?search=
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 14. 新增空白用户（返回 nfc_token 给 NFC 卡写入）
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "长沙"
}

### 15. 重新生成 nfc_token（旧卡失效）
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/REPLACE_USER_ID/regen-token
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 16. 挂失（语义同 regen-token）
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/REPLACE_USER_ID/report-loss
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 17. 停用用户
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/REPLACE_USER_ID/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 18. 用户数据迁移
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceUserId": "REPLACE_SOURCE",
  "targetUserId": "REPLACE_TARGET"
}

### 19. 打卡点列表（含已停用）
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/spots?include_inactive=1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 20. 新增打卡点
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/spots
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "新增点位",
  "asset_key": "spot_07",
  "display_order": 7
}

### 21. 修改打卡点
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/spots/REPLACE_SPOT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "改名",
  "active": false
}

### 22. 补卡
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/check-ins/supplement
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "REPLACE_USER_ID",
  "spotId": "REPLACE_SPOT_ID"
}

### 23. 查看打卡记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/check-ins
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
